Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?ui:=20rebuild=20the=20console=20=E2=80=94=20int?=
 =?UTF-8?q?eractive=20pipeline=20map=20+=20one=20page=20per=20stage?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the single long dashboard with a dark, console-style app:

- Overview (/): live pipeline map from Guidewire (PolicyCenter,
  ClaimCenter, BillingCenter) through the five Qusar agents into the
  four AEGIS stages and out to the outputs. Real decisions animate along
  their actual path (flagged -> evidence, clean -> cleared), every node
  is clickable with a live inspector, and an 8-step guided walkthrough
  explains the whole flow.
- /pipeline/ingestion, /detection, /evidence, /exposure: one page per
  stage with filterable/sortable tables, per-decision pipeline tracks,
  a decision drawer with full trace + raw event, a what-if simulator
  for the denial-outlier rule, category mapping, agent leaderboard,
  heatmap and audit-bundle preview.
- Global "Inject decision" drawer on every page posts a real decision
  and shows its stage-by-stage trace.
- View controllers now just return views; pages read the existing REST
  APIs client-side. Old routes still resolve.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NauLZFu3FKjypuj5Kpe2eG
